# Build context filter for Dockerfile.map (honored by BuildKit for this
# Dockerfile only). Unlike the default .dockerignore, this KEEPS third_party/
# (the satisfactorymap submodule), map-integration/ (overlay + game_data.zip)
# so the map build stage can access them.
node_modules
dist
/state
/data
tmp-test
/Saves
# The game-data archive is fetched (pinned + verified) during the build, never
# copied from context.
map-integration/game_data.zip
docs
!docs/bundled-en-US.json
.env
.env.local
.git
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
plan-*.prompt.md
README.md
